          "target": "H1",
          "relation": "enables"
        }
      ],
      "reason": "This is the immediate documented operational step just before detonation and closes the main causal gap between the scale-up decision and the explosion consequence.",
      "evidence": "\"transferred about half of the synthesized NHP into a mortar, added hexane, and then used a pestle to gently break up the clumps\" and later \"he stirred the NHP “one more time.” At this point, the compound detonated.\"",
      "severity": "high",
      "confidence": "high"
    }
  ],
